    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectre Vigil is an Observation-Duty style horror game with a unique twist: Detecting ghosts! Spot many different abnormalities and handle terrifying entities, all whilst keeping track of what happens and figuring out what plagues these haunted halls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each and every round, a mortifying haunt will inhabit the very halls you stare at, and cause them to suddenly change! Be it as simple as a chair sliding backwards or as monstrous as a lovecraftian bird-horror in the basement, it's your job to not only find these issues, but recognize a pattern from them, and determine <i>exactly</i> what is going to cause this poor rent-payer's apartment to collapse. If you fail? Well.... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm sure the devil is hiring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly 300 Different Abnormalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Fully unique locations with special mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six terrifying haunts with complex abilities and patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand-written journal full of flavor, hints, and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectre Vigil is an Observation-Duty style horror game with a unique twist: Detecting ghosts! Spot many different abnormalities and handle terrifying entities, all whilst keeping track of what happens and figuring out what plagues these haunted halls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each and every round, a mortifying haunt will inhabit the very halls you stare at, and cause them to suddenly change! Be it as simple as a chair sliding backwards or as monstrous as a lovecraftian bird-horror in the basement, it's your job to not only find these issues, but recognize a pattern from them, and determine <i>exactly</i> what is going to cause this poor rent-payer's apartment to collapse. If you fail? Well.... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm sure the devil is hiring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly 300 Different Abnormalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Fully unique locations with special mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six terrifying haunts with complex abilities and patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand-written journal full of flavor, hints, and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
